### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### get Garmin connection status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/garmin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### add Garmin personal key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/garmin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "apiKey": "replace-with-your-garmin-personal-key"
}

### remove Garmin personal key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/garmin
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
